://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-09T08:58:14Z","updated_at":"2025-07-09T08:58:14Z","body":"Thank you for reporting, this is already tracked in:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107095\n\nPlease see there for more details, closing this issue to keep things in one place","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3051774028/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3073924765","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108425#issuecomment-3073924765","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108425","id":3073924765,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63OF6d","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-15T14:46:01Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T14:49:15Z","body":"@AThousandShips I'm not sure if this is a duplicate. #107095 seems to be mainly concerned with additional floating point digits (which may be editor caused), while this issue talks about scientific notation not being used for a large value, as was the case from an earlier version.\ncc @aaronfranke ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3073924765/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4229855078","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108425#issuecomment-4229855078","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108425","id":4229855078,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78Hndm","user":{"login":"SnowmanGao","id":30433313,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDMzMzEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30433313?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnowmanGao","html_url":"https://github.com/SnowmanGao","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnowmanGao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnowmanGao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnowmanGao/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnowmanGao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnowmanGao/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnowmanGao/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnowmanGao/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnowmanGao/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnowmanGao/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-11T17:26:27Z","updated_at":"2026-04-11T17:26:27Z","body":"@AThousandShips\nI think it would also be useful to explicitly track the **inconsistency with the documentation**.\n\n<img width=\"878\" height=\"630\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/90d63057-205a-4fa2-8085-7bf8ec57b45a\" />\n\nThe current documentation for `String.num_scientific()` shows this example:\n\n```gdscript\nvar n = -5.2e8\nprint(n)                        # Prints -520000000\nprint(String.num_scientific(n)) # Prints -5.2e+08\n```\n\nHowever, I re-tested this on `v4.6.2`, and the actual output is:\n\n```gdscript\n-520000000.0\n-520000000\n```\n\nSo even if this is grouped under the broader float serialization issues, the documentation is still describing behavior that users do not get in practice, and the mismatch is still reproducible in `v4.6.2`.\n\nAt minimum, I think one of these should happen:\n\n1. Fix `String.num_scientific()` so it matches the documented example again.\n2. Or update the documentation so it does not show output that is currently incorrect.\n\nRight now, the docs suggest that `String.num_scientific()` will force scientific notation for this value, but that is not what happens in the current version. That makes it especially confusing for users trying to verify whether they are using the API correctly.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4229855078/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]